{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14215210","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14215210","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1421521001:0":{"text":"怎么这里在吵架呀……发生什么了吗？","source_cn":"怎么这里在吵架呀……发生什么了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB388FC0A34846B25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421521002:1":{"text":"这个主持人说我违反了比赛规则……我的参赛资格被取消了！","source_cn":"这个主持人说我违反了比赛规则……我的参赛资格被取消了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x589A05AF0B2EA2E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421521003:1":{"text":"经过调查，你使用的材料确实不是我们提供的，而是自己准备的优质精铁……","source_cn":"经过调查，你使用的材料确实不是我们提供的，而是自己准备...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF477B93519571B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421521004:1":{"text":"我用点好材料有什么不对！还不是为了达到你们说的合格标准！你倒是说说，你们给的材料能炼出什么！","source_cn":"我用点好材料有什么不对！还不是为了达到你们说的合格标准...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF849C4F5C1ED1369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421521005:1":{"text":"可我们制定了规则……","source_cn":"可我们制定了规则……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9398F7C1EE8C55D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title